  "name": "ShopDisplaySpot - Default (seed v1)",
  "description": "A display spot of a shop (display stalls P12, #250, shops DESIGN § 7): a shelf or stall block where the game server shows one of the shop's items as a floating item with its price. Right-click shows the item information, shift-right-click a quick buy (always confirmed). Spots are filled in sort order: a spot's own pin first, then the catalogue's pinned entries, then in-stock items and best sellers; sold-out items are greyed out, or hidden when the shop hides sold-out items. In game, look at the block and use /knk shop display add <shop id> instead.",
